  "definition": "Truck Transfer Stations",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-10-04",
  "historyNote": "#7225, eff 3-31-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 400); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2107.05); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14093, eff 10-4-24",
